          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yooxanaa baa u jawaabay oo ku yidhi, Macallimow, waxaannu aragnay qof magacaaga jinniyo ku saaraya. Nama uu soo raaco. Waannu u diidnay, waayo, isagu nama uu soo raaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin Ciise baa yidhi, Ha u diidina, waayo, ninna ma jiro oo yaab xoog leh magacayga ku sameeyaa oo dhaqso hadal xun iga odhan karaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, kan aan inaga gees ahayn waa inala gees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku alla kii koob biyo ah magacayga idinku siiyaa, maxaa yeelay, waxaad tihiin kuwa Masiix, runtii waxaan idinku leeyahay, Abaalkiisuu ka lumi maayoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.41"
            ]
          }
        }
