          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddii ishaadu ku xumayso, iska bixi. Waxaa kuu wanaagsan inaad boqortooyada Ilaah gashid adigoo il keliya leh intii adigoo laba indhood leh lagugu tuuri lahaa jahannamada ",
          "type": "text",
